{"id":9883,"date":"2024-01-02T11:33:05","date_gmt":"2024-01-02T11:33:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?p=9883"},"modified":"2024-01-03T09:31:40","modified_gmt":"2024-01-03T09:31:40","slug":"congratulating-aims-ghanas-newest-ph-d-graduates","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/congratulating-aims-ghanas-newest-ph-d-graduates\/","title":{"rendered":"Congratulating AIMS Ghana&#8217;s Pioneer Ph.D. Graduates"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We are thrilled to announce and extend our heartfelt congratulations to Edward Korveh and Rhoss B. L. Pellat for their remarkable achievement in successfully defending their Ph.D. theses at the University of Ghana. Both scholars have demonstrated exceptional dedication and scholarly prowess while working under the African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) Ghana-German Research Chair in Mathematics and its Applications. This achievement marks a historic milestone as Rhoss and Edward become the pioneer Ph.D. graduates from the AIMS Ghana Research Centre, underscoring the institution&#8217;s commitment to academic excellence and groundbreaking research.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-1 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" data-id=\"9888\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9888\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_9601-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" data-id=\"9887\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9887\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/01\/IMG_4375-1-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Rhoss B. L. Pellat has contributed significantly to the field of Forward-Backward Stochastic Differential Equations, showcasing his expertise and innovation in this intricate area of mathematical research. Meanwhile, Edward Korveh has excelled in his field of Stochastic Optimal Control with Applications in Finance, reflecting the practical applications of advanced mathematical concepts in real-world scenarios. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Their accomplishments not only signify personal triumphs but also contribute to the broader academic landscape, elevating the reputation of AIMS Ghana as a Centre for cutting-edge research in mathematics. We celebrate Rhoss and Edward as they embark on the next chapter of their academic journey, confident that their contributions will continue to inspire and shape the future of mathematical sciences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are thrilled to an